          "message": "Fix indentation of environmentVariables\n\nWhen using environmentVariables, the template was being rendered like\nthis:\n```yaml\n          - name: CLIENT_SECRET\n            valueFrom:\n              secretKeyRef:\n                name: retool\n                key: google-client-secret\n                    - name: asd\n            value: asd\n          - name: zxc\n            valueFrom:\n              fieldRef:\n                fieldKey: asd\n```\n\nNotice how the indentation for 'asd' is wrong.",
          "tree": {
